{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "b663b635aeb17c19f0266eac34c36f73f7904370668c655be39a2ffe3aa7a70b", "ja": "女王、降臨！　悪魔ショーカン！\n出でよ、真っ黒クロのイニシエの悪魔ーっ！", "zh": "女王，降临！召唤恶魔！\n出来吧，漆黑黑的远古恶魔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e841038096da2a75c30595f430882634d1f688177de9fab30772d077736d3bea", "ja": "真美、何を……って、この前の役に入ってるのか。\n真美は悪魔の女王をやっていたんだよな。", "zh": "真美，你这是在……啊，进入上次的角色了啊。  \n真美之前演的是恶魔女王，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "cb55849ceaa0459bc277bcc7ccb346e79ab2ba5d9c6b13249be54ef6fef8c62f", "ja": "ノンノン、役じゃなく、真美は悪魔女王なのだよ？\nさあ兄ちゃん、この真美様にひれ伏したまえ！", "zh": "不不，不是什么角色，真美就是恶魔女王哦？来吧，哥哥，快向真美大人俯首称臣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "490bd8f4de3c46bf007dde4b883e084ede411c372e8d2be678312769b3f9687c", "ja": "さすれば……あまくておいし～山盛りのオヤツも\nよーきゅーしてあげるぞよ！", "zh": "这样的话……我就帮你要来满满一大堆又甜又好吃的零食哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f6aca119be72d29a5d12f143d0c60eed988ea47ccd7f6892da35de2710660f71", "ja": "いや、どっちも真美しか得しないんだが？\nよっぽど悪魔女王の役が気に入ったのか。", "zh": "不是，怎么选都是只有真美占便宜吧？\n你就这么喜欢恶魔女王这个角色啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fadd93126adfa5347b8ffe45375a2d1cbc6d6f4f4efef061f2f96d840d7d4657", "ja": "それより、小道具の西洋人形が一体見つからないんだ。\n片づけたいんだけど、真美は何か知らないか？", "zh": "说起来，作为道具的西洋人偶少了一只。  \n我想把东西收拾好，真美，你知道些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "6758072a956f82530ae8883576fd2fc29df1f0757887b740d40a0afa42c7d460", "ja": "悪い悪魔のシワザであろうな。んっふっふ～。\nよろしい。悪魔女王の真美様が解決してやろうぞ！", "zh": "肯定是坏恶魔干的好事。嗯哼哼～  \n好吧。恶魔女王真美大人就来解决它吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c17d37e89d1aa3624ea4824b6bd4cbe492f839987d0b90752f42150f84969206", "ja": "悪くない悪魔がいるのか……？　って、それはいいや。\nまた真美のイタズラじゃないだろうな？", "zh": "会有不坏的恶魔吗……？算了，这个先不说。\n这次不会又是真美的恶作剧吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "f6c4ed5408f4f41c6a85143a7af61ead8d899f17539038ebe33a46756b2a3d35", "ja": "悪魔のシワザだって言ってるでしょー！\nそんなこと言うと、探すの協力してあげないかんね！", "zh": "我都说了是恶魔干的嘛——！\n你再这么说，我可就不帮你找了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7a07fd08b4b570cf903f2fc2f70ff058d15923d4e885fda131ae66a835cbb721", "ja": "ごめんごめん。それで、悪魔女王の真美様。\n人形はどこに隠されているのでしょうか？", "zh": "对不起，对不起。那么，恶魔女王真美大人，请问人偶藏在哪里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "1068c646556269003bdf0fbbadbc4bed5ce0d72e1712c926528b07a1e118f5b9", "ja": "では、人形を探すためのギシキから始めよう。\n悪魔ショーカンにはナマニエが必要になる……。", "zh": "那么，就从寻找人偶的仪式开始吧。召唤恶魔需要活祭品……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "798a1d5653ca4ec1bc44cd552c1f123dcec603477f22ae219b450fc9fb6df91f", "ja": "兄ちゃんをナマニエにして、イニシエの悪魔を召喚！\nなくした人形を探シタマエーっ！　むむむ～～……。", "zh": "把哥哥做成半生不熟的祭品，召唤远古恶魔！把丢失的人偶找出来——！唔唔唔～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1012_p", "source_sha256": "966f0ebb074bc699ab62bda90a2ba59517a88bdc8e6d3440be4931b4ee5e7ef9", "ja": "生煮えも生贄も勘弁してくれよ……。\nそれでどうだ？　人形は見つかりそうか？", "zh": "半生不熟还是活祭都饶了我吧……  \n这样呢？人偶有希望找到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "cc30447af8c7f2b49cb9b0c2586a68f2c2f3631d2eb0ed39fc88d35d3f3b8e78", "ja": "見える……見えるぞ……金髪の子どもの人形が……。\nあれだーっ！　あのロッカーの中に人形はある！", "zh": "我看到了……我看到了……一个金发小孩的人偶……。就是那个——！人偶就在那个储物柜里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fde96afbc63c347d6fff80ac1d6d02272591f3b67924561ca909b4bcdbeef07f", "ja": "どれどれ……。\nおお、あった。本当だ！", "zh": "我看看……。\n哦，真的有。没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "6e7171f93f3738d72c70ee5c34c32149d1858fb303c8e9e3fcf3f8ca3c415212", "ja": "ハァハァ…。どう、兄ちゃん。すごかろう？\nこれが、悪魔女王の力ぞ！", "zh": "哈啊哈啊……怎么样，哥哥？很厉害吧？这就是恶魔女王的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1016_p", "source_sha256": "348e34aac49b67b94b99cf28e9196ad2e5f0e0e4e7c6a6d11bc5b64d1985231d", "ja": "うーん、そんなところにしまったっけな……。\nまあともかく、協力ありがとう、真美様。", "zh": "嗯——我记得是收在那种地方吗……  \n总之，谢谢你的帮忙，真美大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "f95996a784342ff3b31dd16f596cd3a33721e1bd06a9db8cda9c67e882d258cf", "ja": "うん、うん、苦しゅうないぞ。これで兄ちゃんも\n悪魔女王のミリキに取りつかれちゃったよねっ！", "zh": "嗯，嗯，免礼啦。这样一来，兄长也\n彻底被恶魔女王的魅～力给迷住了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1ac641c91456039b008cbe3121f4424fd09373a02a326d71829bc20778cb8cba", "ja": "そうだな。ってあれ？　この人形、前と髪型が\n変わってないか？　この間の真美と同じ髪型に……。", "zh": "是啊。咦？这个人偶的发型，是不是和之前不一样了？变成和前阵子真美一样的发型了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "7acd0c3b4e22dd5d6a46b2dbdb764c022af4b8e4cf42d587f360bf4cfabc5d00", "ja": "むむ。それはまさしく、悪い悪魔のシワザ！　決して\n暇だった真美がオソロにして遊んでた～とかじゃなく。", "zh": "唔唔。这正是坏恶魔搞的鬼！绝对不是因为闲着没事的真美把它弄成和自己一样的发型来玩～什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "1395dc6384bb29e3a026b07f56e714fe69690c50a156138d16cacbf10d5b57be", "ja": "……はっ、何やら向こうに悪い悪魔の気配が！？\n捕まえに行かねば！　じゃあまたねっ、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "……哈，那边好像有坏恶魔的气息！？  \n得去把它抓住才行！那回头见啦，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0233_1021_p", "source_sha256": "cc5f5aa8831699bd6b7674c6afdd30ec9d9bbf407d6b2d45a9f440f5d7848944", "ja": "なるほど、悪魔のせいなら仕方ない。あとはよろしく\n……って、そんなワケあるか！　こら、待てー！", "zh": "原来如此，既然是恶魔的错，那也没办法了。剩下的就交给你了。\n……才怪，哪有这种事！喂，给我站住——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
